        ],
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    id: "limits",
    title: "Free-tier limits, and not working around them",
    blocks: [
      "The service is free, and the caps below exist so that one person cannot create unlimited tenants and unlimited load at our expense. As at the date of this policy:",
      {
        ul: [
          "**Three live workspaces per verified identity, free, no card.** If you need a fourth, write to us at legal@commonswarm.com.",
